<block wx:if="{{mode === 'live'}}">
  <view class="page with-dock live-catalog">
    <view class="title">这本书，你想送给谁？</view>
    <view class="subtitle">记录一位重要的人，留下属于自己的故事。</view>
    <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="section note">正在加载套餐与赠礼称呼…</view>
    <view wx:if="{{catalogError}}" class="soft section note"><view>{{catalogError}}</view><button class="link" bindtap="onShow">重新加载</button></view>
    <block wx:if="{{!loading && !catalogError}}">
      <view class="recipients live-recipients section"><button wx:for="{{recipientTypes}}" wx:key="code" class="recipient {{selection && selection.recipientCode === item.code ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-code="{{item.code}}" bindtap="chooseType">送给{{item.label}}</button></view>
      <input data-field="custom-label" class="custom-label" maxlength="40" value="{{customLabelValue}}" placeholder="也可以自定义称呼，最多40字" bindinput="customLabel" />
      <view wx:if="{{selectedLabel}}" class="section section-title">这份礼物，送给{{selectedLabel}}</view>
      <view class="paper section"><view class="section-title">一个项目 · 一本实体书</view><view class="note">一位成年讲述者本人参与，一位发起人。赠礼称呼不改变价格或双方权限。</view><view class="divider"/><view class="note">{{availability}}</view><view wx:if="{{!packagePrice}}" class="small muted">套餐准备完成后，这里将展示服务期限、配送和退款说明。</view></view>
      <view wx:if="{{packageTerms.length}}" class="section"><view class="section-title">套餐与服务说明</view><view wx:for="{{packageTerms}}" wx:key="label" class="catalog-term"><view class="term-label">{{item.label}}</view><view class="note">{{item.text}}</view></view></view>
    </block>
  </view>
  <view class="dock row"><view class="grow"><text wx:if="{{packagePrice}}" class="price">¥{{packagePrice}}</text><view class="small muted">一个项目 · 首本一本</view></view><button class="btn brown live-pay" disabled="{{true}}" bindtap="pay">暂未开放购买</button></view>
</block>
<block wx:else="">
<view class="page with-dock"
  ><view class="title">这本书，你想送给谁？</view
  ><view class="subtitle">让爱有迹可循，让时光有处安放。</view
  ><view class="recipients section"
    ><button
      class="recipient {{recipient === '妈妈' ? 'selected' : ''}}"
      data-recipient="妈妈"
      bindtap="choose"
      ><image class="icon" src="/assets/icons/flower-2.svg" /><text
        >送给妈妈</text
      ><text class="small muted">她的温柔，值得被记住</text></button
    ><button
      class="recipient {{recipient === '爸爸' ? 'selected' : ''}}"
      data-recipient="爸爸"
      bindtap="choose"
      ><image class="icon" src="/assets/icons/sprout.svg" /><text>送给爸爸</text
      ><text class="small muted">他的故事，想慢慢听</text></button
    ></view
  ><view class="paper section"
    ><view class="row"
      ><image
        class="purchase-book"
        src="{{bookImage}}"
        mode="aspectFill"
      /><view class="grow"
        ><view class="serif section-title">{{recipient}}的一生</view
        ><view class="subtitle">爱与岁月的故事</view
        ><view class="pill" style="margin-top: 20rpx"
          >一次购买 · 长久珍藏</view
        ></view
      ></view
    ><view class="divider" /><view class="stack"
      ><view class="row"
        ><image class="icon" src="/assets/icons/mic.svg" /><text
          >语音讲述，整理人生故事</text
        ></view
      ><view class="row"
        ><image class="icon" src="/assets/icons/image.svg" /><text
          >照片与原声，一起留下</text
        ></view
      ><view class="row"
        ><image class="icon" src="/assets/icons/book-open.svg" /><text
          >专属故事书，含1本实体书</text
        ></view
      ></view
    ></view
  ><view class="soft section note"
    >这份礼物需要{{recipient}}参与讲述。每次说一小段，慢慢完成；故事经本人确认后再入书。</view
  ><button class="check-row" bindtap="agree"
    ><view class="check-box {{agreed?'on':''}}"
      ><image class="icon" src="/assets/icons/check-light.svg" /></view
    ><text>我已了解服务内容，并同意服务与隐私说明</text></button
  ><button class="link" bindtap="privacy">查看服务与隐私说明</button
  ><view class="demo-note">前端演示 · 不会产生真实扣款</view></view
><view class="dock row"
  ><view class="grow"
    ><text class="price">¥999</text
    ><view class="small muted">含1本实体书</view></view
  ><button class="btn brown pay-btn" disabled="{{!agreed}}" bindtap="pay"
    >体验购买流程
    <image class="icon" src="/assets/icons/arrow-right-light.svg" /></button
></view>

</block>
